p}(\\frac{5}{12}),$ what is $\\text{SD}[X]?$" :question/worked-solution "If $X∼\\text{Exp}(\\lambda )$ is an exponential random variable, then\n\n$$\n\\text{SD}[X]=\\sqrt{\\text{Var}[X]}=\\frac{1}{\\lambda }.\n$$\n\nTherefore, for our random variable $X∼\\text{Exp}(\\frac{5}{12}),$ we have the following standard deviation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{SD}[X] & =\\frac{1}{(\\frac{5}{12})} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186435629 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166868 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ddb0f6dc-ae8d-59e3-abf9-744916a0bfb1" :knowledge-point/title "Modeling With the Mean of an Exponential Distribution"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44ec7415-7a27-5243-9607-5b175f42433e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$50$ seconds" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435604} {:answer/id #uuid "5b9d27fd-aabb-592a-970d-6cb3e65e217d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$10$ seconds" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435606} {:answer/id #uuid "87116a0e-b0fd-589f-b0b6-86b60598d758" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$5$ minutes" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435607} {:answer/id #uuid "88be2ac4-5f9b-51dd-a35c-cbbade9f3869" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$20$ seconds" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435609} {:answer/id #uuid "b0a9ea69-78b7-59f7-8bab-a664fd5bb220" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$2$ minutes" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435614}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "88be2ac4-5f9b-51dd-a35c-cbbade9f3869" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$20$ seconds" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435609} :answer-field/id #uuid "88193472-deab-50d5-9747-54d755c2e666" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-fi